<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now my life’s begun,</l><l>The “really life” that’s in the Son.</l><l>No more am I enthralled by earth’s empty dreams;</l><l>Deep in me flows a living stream.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>As I turn to Him</l><l>He fills me with His life within.</l><l>His life becomes my life in reality;</l><l>Oh, hallelujah, He’s in me!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I just love You, Lord,</l><l>With other loves, You break the cord.</l><l>You’ll be my life for all eternity;</l><l>You are the only One for me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
